  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  UShapeQ
  @  Quantile: the X below which the probability is p.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "UShapeQ: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → Xminv Xmaxv pv « Xminv 0 + Xmaxv 0 + pv 0 + → Xmin Xmax p « 'Xmin' →Num 'Xmax' →Num 0 0 → lo hi x d « 1 45 START '(lo+hi)/2' →Num 'x' STO '(IFTE(x≤Xmin;0;IFTE(x≥Xmax;1;4*UVAL(UBASE(ASIN(√((x-Xmin)/(Xmax-Xmin))))))))' →Num 'd' STO 'IFTE(d<p;x;lo)' →Num 'lo' STO 'IFTE(d<p;hi;x)' →Num 'hi' STO NEXT '(lo+hi)/2' →Num 'x' STO 1 2 START 'IFTE(ABS(IFTE(x≤Xmin;0;IFTE(x≥Xmax;0;1/(Ⓒπ*√((x-Xmin)*(Xmax-x))))))>0.000000000000000000000000000001;x-((IFTE(x≤Xmin;0;IFTE(x≥Xmax;1;4*UVAL(UBASE(ASIN(√((x-Xmin)/(Xmax-Xmin))))))))-p)/(IFTE(x≤Xmin;0;IFTE(x≥Xmax;0;1/(Ⓒπ*√((x-Xmin)*(Xmax-x))))));x)' →Num 'd' STO 'IFTE((d>lo) AND (d<hi);d;x)' →Num 'x' STO NEXT x Xminv Xmaxv pv 3 →List Drop » » »
